Drop the README demo clip here.

A short GIF (demo.gif) is the best option: it autoplays inline on GitHub with
no click needed. Keep it under about 10MB or GitHub will refuse to render it.

Make one from a finished render with ffmpeg:

  ffmpeg -i output/<slug>/final.mp4 -t 12 -vf "fps=12,scale=800:-1:flags=lanczos" \
    assets/demo/demo.gif

Then uncomment the Demo block near the top of README.md.
